                        "entry_id": "4201344b-370c-3fc8-a979-6caac62df1f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Roman military javelin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37a179af-585a-47c9-bcf1-73ff02c55769",
                                "sense_id": "432814d0-e8d8-3adc-b4dd-5ab271abd5be",
                                "text": "Besides a lighter spear, the Roman legionary grasped in his right hand the formidable pilum, a ponderous javelin whose utmost length was about six feet and which was terminated by a massy triangular point of steel of about eighteen inches."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2acdf556-99d9-4bff-9f2b-1f1ff81bcdef",
                                "sense_id": "432814d0-e8d8-3adc-b4dd-5ab271abd5be",
                                "text": "Verica plucked a pilum from the hands of the nearest legionary – the soldier didn't react – and handed it to me."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5439fbbe-cc80-33bb-b94b-52676d5189a3",
                        "entry_id": "4201344b-370c-3fc8-a979-6caac62df1f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The columella on the surface of a pollen grain."
